  "0 = all drops land at the centre (clean concentric rings expanding outward). 1 = drops scattered across the full disc (chaotic raindrop pattern). Changing this recomputes the simulation.": "0 = 所有雨滴落在中心（干净的同心环向外扩散）。1 = 雨滴散布在整个圆盘上（杂乱的雨滴图案）。更改此项会重新计算模拟。",
  "0 = parallel cylinder beam; 1 = wide cone (tip is 3× source width).": "0 = 平行圆柱光束；1 = 宽锥形（尖端为源宽度的 3 倍）。",
