  "3D arrow — shaft, pointed arrowhead, and four-vane fletching. Full 3D rotation + texturing.": "3D 箭矢——箭杆、尖箭头和四片尾羽。完整的 3D 旋转 + 贴图。",
  "3D bullet — true cylindrical body (14-sided lathe) capped with a curved ogive nose. Brass/copper colour by default. Full 3D rotation, lighting, and texturing.": "3D 子弹——真正的圆柱弹体（14 面旋转体），顶端为弧形卵形弹头。默认黄铜/铜色。完整的 3D 旋转、光照和贴图。",
  "3D hammer — chunky head + long handle. Full 3D rotation + texturing.": "3D 锤子——厚重的锤头 + 长手柄。完整的 3D 旋转 + 贴图。",
  "3D knife — tapered blade and grip handle. Full 3D rotation + texturing.": "3D 刀具——锥形刀刃和握柄。完整的 3D 旋转 + 贴图。",
  "3D spin around the Y (vertical) axis (whole rotations per loop). Integer for seamless loop.": "绕 Y（垂直）轴的 3D 旋转（每循环整圈数）。使用整数以保持循环无缝。",
  "3D spin around the Y (vertical) axis (whole rotations per loop). Integer values keep the loop seamless.": "绕 Y（垂直）轴的 3D 旋转（每循环整圈数）。整数值可保持循环无缝。",
  "3D spin around the Y (vertical) axis.": "绕 Y（垂直）轴的 3D 旋转。",
  "3D sword with tapered blade, crossguard, handle, and octahedral pommel. Full 3D rotation + texturing.": "3D 剑——锥形剑身、护手、剑柄和八面体剑首。完整的 3D 旋转 + 贴图。",
  "3D tumble around the X axis (whole rotations per loop). Integer for seamless loop.": "绕 X 轴的 3D 翻滚（每循环整圈数）。使用整数以保持循环无缝。",
  "3D tumble around the X axis (whole rotations per loop). Integer values keep the loop seamless.": "绕 X 轴的 3D 翻滚（每循环整圈数）。整数值可保持循环无缝。",
  "3D tumble around the X axis.": "绕 X 轴的 3D 翻滚。",
  "4D 3-sphere — nested 2-sphere cross-sections at constant w. 4D rotations mix w with x/y/z so the shells \"morph\" through each other.": "4D 三维球面——在恒定 w 下嵌套的二维球面截面。4D 旋转将 w 与 x/y/z 混合，使各球壳相互“变形”穿越。",
  "4D 5-cell — the simplest 4-polytope, all-triangular faces. The 4D analog of a tetrahedron, rotating through extra dimensions.": "4D 五胞体——最简单的四维多胞体，全部为三角面。它是四面体的四维对应物，在额外维度中旋转。",
  "4D rotation in the XW plane — the iconic \"fold through w\" motion. Integer cycles keep the loop seamless.": "XW 平面内的 4D 旋转——标志性的“穿越 w 折叠”运动。整数循环可保持循环无缝。",
  "4D rotation in the XW plane — the iconic hypersphere \"inside-out\" inversion. Integer cycles for seamless loop.": "XW 平面内的 4D 旋转——标志性的超球面“内外翻转”反转。整数循环可实现无缝循环。",
  "4D rotation in the XW plane — the iconic tesseract \"fold through w\" motion. Integer cycles keep the loop seamless. To slow it, raise the Frames count.": "XW 平面内的 4D 旋转——标志性的超立方体“穿越 w 折叠”运动。整数循环可保持循环无缝。若要减慢，请提高帧数。",
  "4D rotation in the ZW plane — a second 4D fold axis. Combine with Fold A for the classic tumble. Integer cycles for seamless loop.": "ZW 平面内的 4D 旋转——第二个 4D 折叠轴。与折叠 A 组合可获得经典翻滚效果。整数循环可实现无缝循环。",
  "4D rotation in the ZW plane — a second 4D fold axis. Combine with Fold A for the classic tumble. Integer cycles keep the loop seamless.": "ZW 平面内的 4D 旋转——第二个 4D 折叠轴。与折叠 A 组合可获得经典翻滚效果。整数循环可保持循环无缝。",
  "4D rotation in the ZW plane.": "ZW 平面内的 4D 旋转。",
