  "Kaleidoscopic psychedelic mandala — N-fold mirror-symmetric radial pattern with overlapping sinusoidal noise and HSL colour cycling. Crank Symmetry, Flow Speed, and Color Speed for maximum trip.": "万花筒迷幻曼陀罗——N 重镜像对称径向图案，带重叠正弦噪点和 HSL 色彩循环。调高对称、流动速度和颜色速度可获得极致迷幻效果。",
  "Karplus-Strong string dampening. Higher = longer ringing decay. Only affects Karplus waveform.": "Karplus-Strong 弦阻尼。越高 = 振铃衰减越长。仅影响 Karplus 波形。",
