  "Multiplier on the distance between flame tongues, on top of Base Width. 0 = all tongues stacked at the center (single fat column), 1 = default spread, 2-3 = wide separation (distinct flame columns).": "火焰舌间距的倍率，叠加在基础宽度之上。0 = 所有火焰舌堆叠在中心（单一粗柱），1 = 默认扩散，2-3 = 大间距（明显的独立火焰柱）。",
