  "Nudge Layer": "微调图层",
  "Number of bands from the centre to the rim. Higher = finer bands.": "从中心到边缘的色带数量。越高 = 色带越细。",
  "Number of bars in the bar graph. 1 = single column, 24 = dense histogram.": "条形图中的条柱数量。1 = 单列，24 = 密集直方图。",
  "Number of blades around the center. 3 = classic trefoil.": "中心周围的叶片数量。3 = 经典三叶形。",
  "Number of blinking indicator dots in the bottom status bar.": "底部状态栏中闪烁指示点的数量。",
  "Number of bright highlight sparks scattered around the ring. 0 = no sparks.": "环绕圆环散布的明亮高亮火花数量。0 = 无火花。",
  "Number of bright sparkles WITHIN each flame tongue (riding along the centerline). 0 = no internal sizzle.": "每个火焰舌内（沿中心线）的明亮闪光数量。0 = 无内部嘶嘶声。",
  "Number of byte-columns per row. 4 = wide bytes, 32 = dense.": "每行的字节列数。4 = 宽字节，32 = 密集。",
  "Number of byte-rows in the dump. 4 = sparse, 24 = packed.": "转储中的字节行数。4 = 稀疏，24 = 密集。",
  "Number of coloured segments inside the top and bottom horizontal bars.": "顶部和底部横条内的彩色段数量。",
  "Number of concentric range rings.": "同心距离环的数量。",
  "Number of contact blips on the radar.": "雷达上接触光点的数量。",
  "Number of curl waves along each wisp.": "每条光丝上的卷曲波数量。",
  "Number of drop points emitting ripples.": "产生涟漪的雨滴点数。",
  "Number of droplets that eject from each drop on impact. 0 disables.": "每滴雨滴落地时飞溅出的水滴数量。0 禁用。",
  "Number of drops scheduled evenly across the loop. Each drop kicks the water and sustains the ripple field. More drops = more agitated surface / more rings. Changing this recomputes the simulation.": "整个循环中均匀安排的雨滴数量。每滴都激起水面并维持涟漪场。雨滴越多 = 水面越激荡/圆环越多。更改此项会重新计算模拟。",
  "Number of ember sparks rising ABOVE the flame. 0 = no embers.": "火焰上方升起的余烬火花数量。0 = 无余烬。",
  "Number of flame tongues. More = denser flame with more overlapping tongues.": "火焰舌的数量。越多 = 火焰越密，火焰舌重叠越多。",
  "Number of floating pill buttons in the top-right area of the central display.": "中央显示屏右上角区域的浮动胶囊按钮数量。",
  "Number of full rotations from bottom to top of the helix.": "螺旋从底部到顶部的完整旋转次数。",
  "Number of great-circle wisp arcs distributed across the sphere surface. More = denser energy weave covering the bubble.": "分布在球面上的大圆光丝弧数量。越多 = 覆盖气泡的能量织网越密。",
  "Number of horizontal rings stacked along the column.": "沿柱体堆叠的水平环数量。",
  "Number of lightning arcs travelling around the surface. 0 = no arcs.": "沿表面移动的闪电弧数量。0 = 无弧线。",
  "Number of matter streaks spiraling inward toward the horizon. 0 disables.": "向地平线螺旋内落的物质条纹数量。0 禁用。",
  "Number of monitor rows. 1 = single vital; 8 = dense panel.": "监视器行数。1 = 单项生命体征；8 = 密集面板。",
  "Number of particles drifting through the cylinder.": "在圆柱中漂移的粒子数量。",
  "Number of pseudo-text rows in the central display.": "中央显示屏中模拟文本的行数。",
  "Number of pseudo-text rows in the data area. 0 = no text rows.": "数据区域中模拟文本的行数。0 = 无文本行。",
  "Number of ray-planes rotated around the vertical axis. 1 = flat 2D fan (legacy look); 3+ = true spherical starburst with rays radiating in 3D in all directions. Higher = more solid 3D ball but more rendering cost.": "绕垂直轴旋转的光线平面数量。1 = 平面 2D 扇形（传统外观）；3+ = 真正的球形星爆，光线向所有方向辐射 3D。越高 = 3D 球体越实，但渲染成本越高。",
  "Number of rays radiating from the center.": "从中心辐射出的光线数量。",
  "Number of ribbon petals per tongue, rotated around the tongue's vertical axis. 1 = flat sheet (legacy 2D look); 3-4 = true volumetric flame finger that reads as 3D from any angle. Higher = more solid look but more rendering cost.": "每个火焰舌的丝带花瓣数，绕火焰舌垂直轴旋转。1 = 平面片（传统 2D 外观）；3-4 = 从任意角度都呈现 3D 感的真正立体火焰指。越高 = 外观越实，但渲染成本越高。",
  "Number of sine ripples along beam length. 0 = perfectly straight.": "沿光束长度的正弦波纹数量。0 = 完全笔直。",
  "Number of sine waves along each wisp.": "每条光丝上的正弦波数量。",
  "Number of tendrils emanating from the centre.": "从中心发出的触须数量。",
  "Number of vertical pill buttons stacked along the left spine between the elbows.": "左侧脊梁上两肘之间堆叠的垂直胶囊按钮数量。",
  "Number of visible log lines. 3 = sparse status; 16 = packed.": "可见日志行数。3 = 稀疏状态；16 = 密集。",
  "O (Pass)": "O（可通过）",
  "OGG quality": "OGG 质量",
  "OK: replace the Reactor plugin manifest with the RPG Maker one.": "确定：用 RPG Maker 的插件清单替换 Reactor 插件清单。",
  "Obtain EXP": "获得经验值",
  "Obtain Gold": "获得金钱",
  "Obtain Item": "获得物品",
  "Octave change over the full duration. +1 = one octave up, -1 = down.": "整个持续时间内的八度变化。+1 = 升高一个八度，-1 = 降低一个八度。",
  "Ok": "确定",
  "One archive per platform with bundled NW.js runtime": "每个平台一个压缩包，捆绑 NW.js 运行时",
  "One-sided surface with a half-twist. Watch the orientation flip as it rotates.": "带半扭转的单面曲面。观察它旋转时的朝向翻转。",
  "Only smaller validated results replace staged assets.": "只有更小的验证结果才会替换暂存资源。",
  "OGG, MP3, and M4A re-encode in place; WAV and FLAC convert to OGG; loop points carry over.": "OGG、MP3 和 M4A 原地重新编码；WAV 和 FLAC 转换为 OGG；循环点会保留。",
  "Opacity at this keyframe — drag to change just the active KF's opacity; values lerp between keyframes.": "此关键帧的不透明度——拖拽仅更改当前关键帧的不透明度；值在关键帧之间线性插值。",
  "Opacity of a faint solid ring outline behind the wisps. 0 = wisps only (matches the reference image).": "光丝后方微弱实心环轮廓的不透明度。0 = 仅光丝（与参考图像一致）。",
  "Opacity of horizontal CRT scanlines overlaid on the noise. 0 = no scanlines.": "叠加在噪点上的水平 CRT 扫描线的不透明度。0 = 无扫描线。",
  "Open a project before installing the Reactor runtime.": "安装 Reactor 运行时前请先打开一个项目。",
  "Open a project first — hair parts save into the project's forge library.": "请先打开项目——发型部件会保存到项目的 Forge 素材库中。",
  "Open a project first — outfits save into the project's forge library.": "请先打开项目——服装会保存到项目的 Forge 素材库中。",
  "Open a project first.": "请先打开一个项目。",
  "Open a project to use Forge tools.": "打开一个项目以使用锻造工具。",
