  "Probability of optional cross-chord (ring) or distance-link (grid) edges. Ring topology always includes neighbor edges.": "可选交叉弦（环形）或距离连接（网格）边的概率。环形拓扑始终包含相邻边。",
  "Procedural / Outfit / Hair Forge parts are JS templates and appear on the Procedural tab, not here.": "程序化/服装/头发锻造部件是 JS 模板，显示在“程序化”标签页中，而不是这里。",
