  "Radial perturbation amount for the wispy curves — how much they bulge in/out from the mean radius.": "光丝曲线的径向扰动量——它们从平均半径内外凸出的程度。",
  "Radial rays from a glowing core with optional rotation + pulse. Holy bursts, sunbeams, lens flares, beacons.": "来自发光核心的径向光线，可选旋转 + 脉动。圣光爆发、阳光、镜头光晕、信标。",
