  "Soft halo behind each tongue. Adds warmth without blurring the flame edges.": "每个火焰舌背后的柔和光晕。增添温暖感而不模糊火焰边缘。",
  "Soft halo behind every ring. 0 = sharp wireframe.": "每个圆环背后的柔和光晕。0 = 锐利线框。",
