  "Soft sine with gentle decay + filter close.": "柔和正弦波，温和衰减 + 滤波器闭合。",
  "Solid fill alpha. 0 = outline only.": "实心填充透明度。0 = 仅轮廓。",
  "Solid fill of the silhouette body (even-odd).": "剪影主体的实心填充（奇偶规则）。",
  "Source point X (fraction of frame width). 0 = left edge, 0.5 = center, 1 = right edge.": "源点 X（帧宽的比例）。0 = 左边缘，0.5 = 中央，1 = 右边缘。",
  "Source point Y (fraction of frame height). 0 = top, 0.5 = center, 1 = bottom.": "源点 Y（帧高的比例）。0 = 顶部，0.5 = 中央，1 = 底部。",
  "Source type. Karplus synthesises a plucked string via physical modelling.": "声源类型。Karplus 通过物理建模合成拨弦声。",
