  "Spatial decay tail (wet mix). 0 = dry, 1 = mostly wet.": "空间衰减尾音（湿声混合）。0 = 干声，1 = 以湿声为主。",
  "Spatial frequency multiplier for the noise field — higher = finer / busier patterns.": "噪声场的空间频率倍率——越高 = 图案越细/越密。",
