  "Spear 01": "长枪 01",
  "Specific version": "指定版本",
  "Spherical force-field bubble around its center. Energy wisps are great-circle arcs distributed evenly across the sphere surface, with silhouette-weighted alpha so the bubble outline reads brightest at the rim (fresnel-edged). Use it as a shield/aura around a character or object.": "围绕其中心的球形力场气泡。能量光丝是均匀分布在球面上的大圆弧，带轮廓加权透明度，使气泡轮廓在边缘处最亮（菲涅尔边缘）。可用作角色或物体周围的护盾/光环。",
  "Spread of brightness between dark and bright pixels. 0 = flat mid-grey; 1 = full black-to-white range.": "暗亮像素之间的亮度分布。0 = 平坦中灰；1 = 全黑到全白范围。",
  "Sprite Sheet": "行走图集",
  "Sprite-based": "基于行走图",
  "Square with medium attack + filter sweep open.": "方波，中速起音 + 滤波器扫频打开。",
  "Staff": "法杖",
  "Standard NW.js runtime": "标准 NW.js 运行时",
  "Star Trek-style LCARS console with the iconic curved elbows, coloured pill buttons, segmented top/bottom bars, and a central display populated with scrolling pseudo-text. Defaults to canonical LCARS palette.": "星际迷航风格 LCARS 控制台，带标志性弧形弯肘、彩色胶囊按钮、分段式顶/底条，以及充满滚动模拟文本的中央显示屏。默认为标准 LCARS 调色板。",
  "Star-Trek-transporter-style energy column: stacked glowing rings around a vertical axis, drifting particle field inside the cylinder, and optional data-fragment overlays. Tilt the column to reveal each ring as a real 3D ellipse.": "星际迷航传送器风格能量柱：绕垂直轴堆叠的发光圆环、圆柱内漂移的粒子场，以及可选的数据碎片叠加。倾斜柱体可看到每个圆环呈现真正的 3D 椭圆。",
  "Stargate-style event horizon with deterministic rain drops driving a periodic ripple field. Per-pixel refraction warps the base radial gradient for the rippling-liquid look.": "星际之门风格事件视界，确定性雨滴驱动周期性涟漪场。逐像素折射扭曲基础径向渐变，呈现波光液体效果。",
  "Start Build": "开始构建",
  "Start Transparent": "起始透明",
  "Starting Positions": "初始位置",
  "Starting hue for the colour wheel (degrees). 0 = red, 120 = green, 240 = blue, 280 = canonical psychedelic purple.": "色轮起始色相（度）。0 = 红，120 = 绿，240 = 蓝，280 = 标准迷幻紫。",
  "Starting hue for the rainbow distribution (degrees). 0 = red, 120 = green, 240 = blue.": "彩虹分布的起始色相（度）。0 = 红，120 = 绿，240 = 蓝。",
  "Stat names used in the status menu, equipment screen, and damage formulas.": "状态菜单、装备画面和伤害公式中使用的属性名称。",
