  "Streaking comet with a glowing nucleus, tapered particle tail, and sparkling debris trail.": "拖尾彗星，带发光彗核、锥形粒子彗尾和闪烁碎片轨迹。",
  "Strength of the specular highlight crescents + caustic glow. 0 = matte, 1 = glossy wet.": "镜面高光月牙 + 焦散辉光的强度。0 = 哑光，1 = 湿亮光泽。",
  "Strength of the texture overlay on the flame. 0 = base colors only. Only relevant when a Texture is set.": "火焰上纹理叠加的强度。0 = 仅基础颜色。仅在设置了纹理时相关。",
  "Stroke around the cross outline. 0 disables.": "十字轮廓周围的描边。0 禁用。",
  "Stroke around the full disc. 0 disables.": "整个圆盘周围的描边。0 禁用。",
  "Stroke around the outline. 0 = fill only.": "轮廓周围的描边。0 = 仅填充。",
  "Stroke around the silhouette. 0 = fill only.": "剪影周围的描边。0 = 仅填充。",
  "Stroke around the silhouettes. 0 = fill only.": "剪影周围的描边。0 = 仅填充。",
  "Stroke thickness at the wisp base (tapers toward the tip according to Taper).": "光丝基部的描边厚度（根据锥度向尖端渐细）。",
  "Stroke thickness multiplier for each wisp.": "每条光丝的描边厚度倍率。",
