  "Stroke width of arcs and surface ring.": "弧线和表面环的描边宽度。",
  "Stroke width of each bolt core.": "每道闪电核心的描边宽度。",
  "Stroke width of each helical strand.": "每条螺旋条带的描边宽度。",
  "Stroke width of each ring.": "每个圆环的描边宽度。",
  "Stroke width of the outline. 0 = no outline.": "轮廓的描边宽度。0 = 无轮廓。",
  "Studs": "铆钉",
  "Sub-oscillator detune in semitones. -12 = one octave down (adds bass weight). Positive = chorus.": "子振荡器半音失谐。−12 = 低一个八度（增加低音分量）。正值 = 合唱效果。",
