  "System boot sequence with progress bar, scrolling boot-log text, and a blinking cursor. Wide slider ranges yield everything from sparse loading screen to dense error spam.": "系统启动流程，带进度条、滚动启动日志文本和闪烁光标。宽滑块范围可产生从稀疏加载画面到密集错误刷屏的各种效果。",
