  "Terrain Tag (0-7)": "地形标志（0-7）",
  "Text": "文本",
  "The $ symbol — S-curve with a vertical bar through it. Full 3D rotation.": "美元符号 $——带贯穿竖线的 S 曲线。完整的 3D 旋转。",
  "The Soviet emblem — a sickle blade crossed by a hammer. Geometry ported from the canonical flag SVG. Full 3D rotation.": "苏联徽章——锤子与镰刀交叉。几何图形移植自标准旗帜 SVG。完整的 3D 旋转。",
  "The current map could not be saved.": "当前地图无法保存。",
  "The map could not be saved. The current view will remain open.": "地图无法保存。当前视图将保持打开。",
  "The previous RPG Maker runtime was archived to": "之前的 RPG Maker 运行时已归档到",
  "The project database could not be loaded. Check the JSON files for parse errors.": "项目数据库无法加载。请检查 JSON 文件是否存在解析错误。",
  "The taijitu — a disc divided by an S-curve into two interlocking teardrops with opposite-colored dots in each. Full 3D rotation.": "太极图——由 S 曲线将圆盘分为两个互锁的泪滴形，各含一颗对色圆点。完整的 3D 旋转。",
  "The ¥ symbol — Y diagonals + vertical descender + two crossbars. Full 3D rotation.": "日元符号 ¥——Y 形对角线 + 垂直下伸线 + 两条横杠。完整的 3D 旋转。",
  "The € symbol — C-arc with two horizontal bars. Full 3D rotation.": "欧元符号 €——带两条水平横杠的 C 形弧。完整的 3D 旋转。",
  "There are unsaved changes in": "以下位置有未保存的更改",
  "There is already an event at this position.": "此位置已有一个事件。",
  "Thickness multiplier of each ripple ring.": "每个涟漪环的厚度倍率。",
  "Thickness of the bright disk around the horizon (fraction of event radius). 0 = no disk.": "视界周围亮盘（吸积盘）的厚度（事件半径的比例）。0 = 无圆盘。",
  "This command has no parameters.": "此指令没有参数。",
  "This entry can be removed and saved.": "此条目可以被移除并保存。",
  "This is a single-character sheet.": "这是单角色图集。",
  "This moves the RPG Maker corescript, js/libs, and index.html into rpgmaker-runtime-backup.zip in the project folder, then installs the Reactor engine files (reactor_*.js and js/libs) in their place.": "这将 RPG Maker 核心脚本、js/libs 和 index.html 移入项目文件夹中的 rpgmaker-runtime-backup.zip，然后原位安装 Reactor 引擎文件（reactor_*.js 和 js/libs）。",
  "This plugin file carries no parameter annotations, so its saved values are shown as plain fields. Labels, descriptions and pickers are unavailable; the values themselves are correct and editable.": "此插件文件没有参数注释，因此其已保存的值显示为纯字段。标签、说明和选择器不可用；数值本身正确且可编辑。",
  "This plugin has no configurable parameters.": "此插件没有可配置参数。",
  "This project is already open in another RPG Reactor instance.": "此项目已在另一个 RPG Reactor 实例中打开。",
  "This removes its": "这将移除其",
