  "This updates the engine files (reactor_*.js and js/libs) to this editor's versions. Your plugin manifest and game data are untouched.": "这会将引擎文件（reactor_*.js 和 js/libs）更新为当前编辑器版本。你的插件清单和游戏数据不受影响。",
