  "Vertical center (fraction of frame height). 0 = top, 0.5 = middle, 1 = bottom.": "垂直中心（帧高的比例）。0 = 顶部，0.5 = 中间，1 = 底部。",
  "Vertical center (fraction of frame height). 0.5 = middle, 0 = top, 1 = bottom.": "垂直中心（帧高的比例）。0.5 = 中间，0 = 顶部，1 = 底部。",
  "Vertical center of the horizontal arm. 0 = centered (Greek cross); 0.3 = upper third (Latin).": "水平臂的垂直中心。0 = 居中（希腊十字）；0.3 = 上三分之一（拉丁）。",
  "Vertical center of the shape (fraction of frame height). 0 = top, 0.5 = center, 1 = bottom.": "形状的垂直中心（帧高的比例）。0 = 顶部，0.5 = 中央，1 = 底部。",
  "Vertical cycles each particle completes per loop. Integer for seamless looping.": "每循环每个粒子完成的垂直周期数。无缝循环需要整数。",
  "Vertical extent of the column (column height as a fraction of size). 1.0 = column-as-tall-as-wide, 1.6 = taller transporter pad.": "柱体的垂直范围（柱高为整体尺寸的比例）。1.0 = 柱体等高等宽，1.6 = 更高的传送台。",
  "Vertical extent of the tornado (fraction of frame height).": "龙卷风的垂直范围（帧高的比例）。",
  "Vertical extent of where drops spawn (fraction of frame height). 0 = all on a horizontal line.": "雨滴生成位置的垂直范围（帧高的比例）。0 = 全部在一条水平线上。",
  "Vertical position (fraction of frame height). 0 = top, 0.5 = center, 1 = bottom.": "垂直位置（帧高的比例）。0 = 顶部，0.5 = 中央，1 = 底部。",
  "Vertical position of the 4-point star (USSF default: -0.28, in the lower interior). Negative = lower, positive = upper.": "四角星的垂直位置（USSF 默认：−0.28，位于下部内侧）。负值 = 更低，正值 = 更高。",
  "Vertical position of the flame base (0 = top of frame, 1 = bottom). Default 0.8 puts the base near the bottom edge.": "火焰基底部的垂直位置（0 = 画面顶部，1 = 底部）。默认 0.8 将基底部放在靠近底边处。",
  "Vertical position of the ring (above triangle apex, ≈0.81 by default).": "圆环的垂直位置（三角形顶点上方，默认约 0.81）。",
  "Vertical reach of each waveform. 0.2 = flat, 1.5 = clipping into neighbor row.": "每个波形的垂直伸展。0.2 = 平缓，1.5 = 切入相邻行。",
  "Vertical scale of the helix. 1 = unit cube (default), 0.3 = squat, 2-3 = tall and stretched.": "螺旋的垂直缩放。1 = 单位立方体（默认），0.3 = 矮胖，2-3 = 高而拉伸。",
  "Vest 01": "背心 01",
