  "Void Crimson": "虚空深红",
  "Vol:": "音量：",
  "Volume wobble depth. 0 = none, 1 = amplitude oscillates fully (0 to peak). Creates \"wa-wa\" or alarm effects.": "音量摆动深度。0 = 无，1 = 振幅完全振荡（0 到峰值）。产生“哇哇”或警报效果。",
  "Volume wobble speed (Hz). Low = slow swell, high = motorboat / buzzer.": "音量摆动速度（Hz）。低 = 缓慢起伏，高 = 摩托艇/蜂鸣器。",
