  "Waveshaper distortion amount. For Karplus: pluck hardness (0 = mellow, 1 = bright/clicky).": "波形整形失真量。对于 Karplus：拨弦硬度（0 = 柔和，1 = 明亮/清脆）。",
  "Wavy surface chop on each ring outline. 0 = perfect circles, 1.5 = roiling sea.": "每个圆环轮廓上的波浪形表面起伏。0 = 完美圆形，1.5 = 翻涌海面。",
