  "When Cancel": "当取消",
  "Where the rays START (distance from center, fraction of frame). 0 = rays start from the point center.": "光线的起始位置（距中心的距离，帧的比例）。0 = 光线从点中心开始。",
  "White-hot center of the beam.": "光束的白热中心。",
  "Whole 2D rotations in the screen plane per loop. Integer for seamless loop.": "每循环屏幕平面内的完整 2D 旋转次数。使用整数以保持循环无缝。",
  "Whole 2D rotations in the view plane during the animation. Integer values keep the loop seamless.": "动画期间视图平面内的完整 2D 旋转次数。整数值可保持循环无缝。",
  "Whole Map": "整个地图",
  "Whole cycles per loop of the underlying noise waves. Integer for seamless looping. Higher = more violent motion.": "每循环底层噪声波的完整周期数。无缝循环需要整数。越高 = 运动越剧烈。",
  "Whole hue rotations per loop. Integer keeps loop seamless. 0 = static colors.": "每循环完整色相旋转次数。整数可保持循环无缝。0 = 静态颜色。",
  "Whole orbits per loop. Integer for seamless looping. 0 = stationary head — use Static Angle to point the tail.": "每循环完整轨道数。无缝循环需要整数。0 = 静止头部——使用静态角度指向尾部。",
  "Whole rainbow cycles per loop (hue rotation over time). Integer for seamless looping. 0 = static palette.": "每循环完整彩虹周期数（随时间旋转色相）。无缝循环需要整数。0 = 静态调色板。",
  "Whole rotations around the X axis per loop. Integer for seamless loop.": "每循环绕 X 轴的完整旋转次数。使用整数以保持循环无缝。",
  "Whole rotations around the Y axis per loop. Integer for seamless loop.": "每循环绕 Y 轴的完整旋转次数。使用整数以保持循环无缝。",
  "Whole rotations around the vertical axis during the animation. Integer values keep the loop seamless. To slow apparent rotation, raise the Frames count at the top.": "动画期间绕垂直轴的完整旋转次数。整数值可保持循环无缝。要减慢表观旋转，请提高顶部的帧数。",
  "Whole rotations around the vertical axis during the animation. Integer values keep the loop seamless. To slow rotation, raise the Frames count at the top.": "动画期间绕垂直轴的完整旋转次数。整数值可保持循环无缝。要减慢旋转，请提高顶部的帧数。",
  "Whole rotations forward/back during the animation. Integer values keep the loop seamless. To slow apparent rotation, raise the Frames count at the top.": "动画期间前后方向的完整旋转次数。整数值可保持循环无缝。要减慢表观旋转，请提高顶部的帧数。",
  "Whole rotations of the kaleidoscope pattern per loop. Integer for seamless looping. Positive = clockwise, negative = counter-clockwise, 0 = no rotation.": "每循环万花筒图案的完整旋转次数。无缝循环需要整数。正值 = 顺时针，负值 = 逆时针，0 = 不旋转。",
  "Whole rotations of the ring vertices around the column axis per loop. Integer keeps the loop seamless.": "每循环圆环顶点绕柱体轴的完整旋转次数。整数可保持循环无缝。",
  "Whole rotations of the wisps around the ring per loop. Integer for seamless loop.": "每循环光丝绕圆环的完整旋转次数。使用整数以保持循环无缝。",
  "Whole rotations per loop. Positive = clockwise illusion (inward draw); negative = counter-clockwise (outward push). Integer for seamless loop.": "每循环完整旋转次数。正值 = 顺时针错觉（向内吸入）；负值 = 逆时针（向外推）。使用整数以保持循环无缝。",
  "Whole shimmer-wave cycles per loop along the tail. Integer = seamless loop. 0 = wisps hold a fixed shape; higher = more flowing/rippling motion.": "每循环沿尾部的完整微光波周期数。整数 = 无缝循环。0 = 光丝保持固定形状；越高 = 流动/涟漪运动越多。",
  "Whoosh slash through air.": "划破空气的嗖嗖斩击声。",
