 const keys=["A .webm or .mp4 file in the movies folder, named without its extension.","The movies folder has no .webm or .mp4 file yet.","A roof has to be an autotile (A1-A4). Click one, or click the wall again to clear.","World: a battle on a map without a battleback takes one from the terrain. Area: it takes none.","Align Bottom","Play the effect at the target's feet instead of its middle.","Textures only: its rig is bound to the mesh as it is. To reduce the mesh, remove the rig, optimize, then rig the model again.","This model’s rig is bound to its mesh, and converting to GLB rebuilds the mesh. Remove the rig, optimize, then rig the model again.","The sprite sheet is being drawn. Try again in a moment.","This map could not be opened.","Timer 2","{n} seconds or less left"];
